iga-element-material.out
IGA material lookup: element mat fallback and a cross-section material give the same uniaxial solution
LinearStatic nsteps 1 nmodules 1
errorcheck
domain 2dPlaneStress
OutputManager tstep_all dofman_all element_all
ndofman 8 nelem 2 ncrosssect 2 nmat 1 nbc 3 nic 0 nltf 1 nset 3
node 1 coords 3 0. 0. 0.
node 2 coords 3 10. 0. 0.
node 3 coords 3 10. 2. 0.
node 4 coords 3 0. 2. 0.
node 5 coords 3 12. 0. 0.
node 6 coords 3 22. 0. 0.
node 7 coords 3 22. 2. 0.
node 8 coords 3 12. 2. 0.
# Element 1 gets its material through mat; SimpleCS 1 deliberately has no material field.
# Element 2 is an identical, translated reference patch with the material assigned to SimpleCS 2.
bsplineplanestresselement 1 nodes 4 1 2 4 3 crosssect 1 mat 1 knotvectoru 2 0 1 knotvectorv 2 0 1 degree 2 1 1 nip 4
bsplineplanestresselement 2 nodes 4 5 6 8 7 crosssect 2 knotvectoru 2 0 1 knotvectorv 2 0 1 degree 2 1 1 nip 4
SimpleCS 1 thick 0.15
SimpleCS 2 thick 0.15 material 1
IsoLE 1 d 0. E 15. n 0.25 tAlpha 0.
BoundaryCondition 1 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 1 values 1 0. set 1
BoundaryCondition 2 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 2 values 1 0. set 2
BoundaryCondition 3 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 1 values 1 1. set 3
ConstantFunction 1 f(t) 1.
Set 1 nodes 4 1 4 5 8
Set 2 nodes 4 1 2 5 6
Set 3 nodes 4 2 3 6 7
# Exact solution on each 10 x 2 patch: eps_x = 0.1, eps_y = -0.025, sigma_x = 1.5.
# Each vertical edge carries 1.5 * 0.15 * 2 = 0.45, split equally between its two nodes.
#%BEGIN_CHECK% tolerance 1.e-8
#NODE tStep 1 number 2 dof 1 unknown d value 1.0
#NODE tStep 1 number 3 dof 2 unknown d value -0.05
#NODE tStep 1 number 4 dof 2 unknown d value -0.05
#NODE tStep 1 number 6 dof 1 unknown d value 1.0
#NODE tStep 1 number 7 dof 2 unknown d value -0.05
#NODE tStep 1 number 8 dof 2 unknown d value -0.05
#REACTION tStep 1 number 1 dof 1 value -0.225
#REACTION tStep 1 number 2 dof 1 value 0.225
#REACTION tStep 1 number 3 dof 1 value 0.225
#REACTION tStep 1 number 4 dof 1 value -0.225
#REACTION tStep 1 number 5 dof 1 value -0.225
#REACTION tStep 1 number 6 dof 1 value 0.225
#REACTION tStep 1 number 7 dof 1 value 0.225
#REACTION tStep 1 number 8 dof 1 value -0.225
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 1 keyword 1 component 1 value 1.5
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 1 keyword 1 component 2 value 0.0
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 1 gp 1 keyword 1 component 6 value 0.0
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 2 gp 1 keyword 1 component 1 value 1.5
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 2 gp 1 keyword 1 component 2 value 0.0
#ELEMENT tStep 1 number 2 gp 1 keyword 1 component 6 value 0.0
#%END_CHECK%
